    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers are delighted to offer for sale this spacious and beautifully appointed residence with breathtaking views over the river Deel from this waterfront property. The property is located less than 3 km from the village of Askeaton, 8km to Foynes, 18km to Adare & 26 km to Limerick City. \r\nThe accommodation is comprised of an entrance hallway, living room, sitting room, fully fitted kitchen, sunroom, utility room, downstairs bedroom with en-suite, walk in wardrobe, upstairs five bedrooms, Jack & Jill ensuite, main family bathroom.  The house benefits from oil fired central heating. Outside the substantial 0.74acre site consists of lawns front and rear with a number of outhouses. There is a stone driveway leading to the house from electric entrance gates. This exceptional property is a must see for anyone with an interest in boating, fishing or just watching the world go by on the slow waters of the broad majestic river Deel. Viewing of this super property is recommended to appreciate, contact Peter Kearney at Rooney Auctioneers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway - 5.07m x 4.71m + 4.30m x 2.00m Having real wood flooring \r\nLiving Room 1 - 4.46m x 4.70m with open fireplace \r\nDownstairs Bedroom - 4.31m x 3.40m \r\nEnsuite - 1.99m x 2.09m \r\nWalk in Wardrobe - 2.04m x 2.04m\r\nKitchen - 5.30m x 5.05m\r\nSunroom - 3.97m x 5.19m\r\nLiving Room - 4.90m x 4.92m having stove fireplace \r\nUtility Room - 2.56m x 2.93m fitted units \r\nW.C. - 0.85m x 2.08m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 2.34m x 4.98m \r\nWalk in Wardrobe 0.64m x 2.06m\r\nBathroom 1 - 2.13m x 1.70m\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.43m x 4.24m\r\nWalk in Wardrobe - 0.88m x 1.74m\r\nHallway - 3.5m x 2.00m + 8.00m + 1.20m\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.60m x 3.31m \r\nWalk in Wardrobe - 0.64 x 1.74\r\nBathroom - 3.72m x 3.44m \r\nBedroom 4 - 4.92m x 4.92m\r\nBedroom 5 - 3.73m x 4.40m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Built in 2002\r\nHigh energy rating of B3\r\nBreathtaking views over the river Deel and having its own private Jetty\r\nPrivate setting,\r\nConnected to group scheme for mains water\r\nSeptic tank sewerage system\r\nOutside lighting, sockets,\r\n\r\n\r\nDouble Glazed PVC windows, Oil fired central heating\r\nSpacious and beautifully appointed residence which is situated on a landscaped site of approx. 0.74 acre - less than 3 km from the village of Askeaton, 8km to Foynes, 18km to Adare & 26km to Limerick City. Hall, living room, sitting room, kitchen-diner, utility, 5/6 bedrooms, en-suite & main bathroom. Lawns front & rear with a number of outhouses. The house is in excellent condition."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B3"
      },
      {
